unknown wand which _might_ be cancellation, I #name that type something
like "CANCEL?"; and I also name my BoH "HOLDING". Both in capitals.
OTOH, I'll happily put _known_ empty sacks and oilskin bags in my BoH.

In all the time I've used this strategy, I've only once exploded a BoH,
and that was because I fumbled greatly on my keyboard and accidentally
put _everything_ in it. The only way to avoid that explosion would have
been not to carry a BoH at all, or not to carry /oCancel at all. Since I
was using both, not a viable option. Apart from that, no problems at
